# Deprecated for the OpenCode-managed proxy path.
#
# OpenCode provider credentials are stored by:
#
#   opencode auth login -p openai-bailiab-api
#   opencode auth login -p openai-bailian-token-plan
#   opencode auth login -p openai-idealab
#   opencode auth login -p anthropic-idealab-cached
#
# Cached upstream URLs and cache options are written into opencode.json provider
# options.headers by bin/bailian-cache-proxy-configure.mjs. Direct providers,
# such as openai-idealab, keep their upstream URL in options.baseURL. The
# production OpenCode proxy entrypoint does not load proxy/.env.
#
# Runtime-only process environment overrides still work when exported by the
# launcher, for example:
#
# BAILIAN_CACHE_PROXY_PORT=48761
# BAILIAN_CACHE_PROXY_MIN_TOKENS=1024
# BAILIAN_CACHE_PROXY_USAGE_LOG=/absolute/path/to/usage.jsonl
